Alembic migrations for the CompIQCoreBe project (JVRE backend).

The database URL is loaded by env.py from app.core.config (via the
DATABASE_URL environment variable / .env file). Do NOT set sqlalchemy.url
in alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from the project root):

    uv run alembic current                       # show applied revision
    uv run alembic history                       # show migration history
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"  # generate migration
    uv run alembic upgrade head                  # apply latest
    uv run alembic downgrade -1                  # revert one step
